  "intersectionText": "Our approach sits where creativity and technical imagination meet. We explore emerging technologies with a practical, artistic eye, shaping them into experiences that feel human and memorable.\n\nOur curiosity is what keeps our work moving forward. It pushes us to stay close to new ideas, new tools and new ways of seeing. It keeps our aesthetics evolving and our technical approach sharp. It’s the energy that ensures every project feels considered and ready for the world it’s going into.",
  "intersectionTitle": "art, technology, experience.",
  "sectionOneCallout": "Studio Dialect explores how technology can shape the way people move, feel and interact. \n\nFrom websites to installations, we design experiences that sit comfortably at the edge of what’s possible, guided by a belief in thoughtful design, meaningful experiences and a love of solving hard problems.",
  "sectionOneCalloutLink": {
    "label": "ALL PROJECTS",
    "url": "/projects"
  },
  "sectionOneTitle": "INTERSECTING\nCULTURE",
  "sectionOneTitleBottom": "&\nTECHNOLOGY",
  "sectionTwoText": "Our work is grounded in research and experimentation. We help brands make sense of emerging technologies and turn them into clear, purposeful experiences that stay with people. \n\nEverything we create is built in close collaboration with our clients and agency partners, working together to bring ideas to life with clarity and intention.",
